{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783356768491,"sessionID":"ses_0c7a8b531ffeuOrJ1VP4DyRKSR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b191f8fbd986f749","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{
  "summary": "libserialport_jll 是 Julia 生态中由 BinaryBuilder 自动生成的 JLL 包装包，为 sigrok 项目的 libserialport C 库提供跨平台预编译二进制产物与 Julia 动态加载绑定。libserialport 是一个轻量级跨平台串口通信 C 库，支持 Linux、macOS、Windows 等操作系统的串口枚举、配置与数据读写。本包本身不含串口逻辑，仅负责在 Julia 运行时中定位并加载对应平台的 libserialport 共享库。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "预编译二进制分发",
      "description": "通过 Artifacts.toml 声明 15 个平台（Linux aarch64/armv6l/armv7l/i686/x86_64/powerpc64le、macOS aarch64/x86_64、Windows i686/x86_64，含 glibc/musl 变体）的预编译 tarball，Julia 包管理器安装时自动下载对应平台二进制。",
      "evidence": ["Artifacts.toml", "README.md:17-33"]
    },
    {
      "name": "动态库加载绑定",
      "description": "使用 JLLWrappers 宏在模块初始化时通过 dlopen（RTLD_LAZY | RTLD_DEEPBIND）加载 libserialport 共享库（.so/.dylib/.dll），并将 LibraryProduct 导出供上层 Julia 包调用。",
      "evidence": ["src/wrappers/x86_64-linux-gnu.jl:5-12", "src/wrappers/x86_64-apple-darwin.jl:5-12", "src/wrappers/x86_64-w64-mingw32.jl:5-12"]
    },
    {
      "name": "跨平台路径适配",
      "description": "为每个目标平台生成独立的 wrapper 脚本，适配不同平台的共享库命名约定（Linux: libserialport.so.0、macOS: @rpath/libserialport.0.dylib、Windows: libserialport-0.dll）与安装路径（lib/ vs bin\\）。",
      "evidence": ["src/wrappers/x86_64-linux-gnu.jl:5", "src/wrappers/x86_64-apple-darwin.jl:5", "src/wrappers/x86_64-w64-mingw32.jl:5,10"]
    }
  ],
  "domain": "串口通信",
  "target_users": "需要在 Julia 中使用 libserialport 串口通信功能的开发者"
}","filePath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/pc-lib-3456/libserialport_jll.jl/2026-07-06T15-26-27-238Z/blocks/function_summary.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/pc-lib-3456/libserialport_jll.jl/2026-07-06T15-26-27-238Z/blocks/function_summary.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"runs/pc-lib-3456/libserialport_jll.jl/2026-07-06T15-26-27-238Z/blocks/function_summary.json","time":{"start":1783356768481,"end":1783356768489}},"id":"prt_f38588841001UowwT5WH3EV32S","sessionID":"ses_0c7a8b531ffeuOrJ1VP4DyRKSR","messageID":"msg_f38587e27001NOssA90zfH8yr5"}}

